// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ChoseCleopatra 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P666081417" "Cleopatra's Deal"
// DetailString :
"P877671998" "You went into Cleopatra's office to find Washington facing her down, accusing Cleopatra of charges against Praetoria. Washington looked to you for help in carrying out his death sentence on Cleopatra.<br><br>Instead, you sided with Cleopatra and aided her in killing Washington. The two of you concocted a plan to cover everything up. Cleopatra would plant false evidence to implicate that <i>Washington</i> was the spy, while you would ensure that everything was cleaned up smoothly with Praetor White."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - ChoseWashington 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P100077451" "Washington's Plan"
// DetailString :
"P3477879946" "You went into Cleopatra's office to find Washington facing her down, accusing Cleopatra of charges against Praetoria. Washington looked to you for help in carrying out his death sentence on Cleopatra.<br><br>You helped Washington carry out his judgment on Cleopatra, looking to keep the peace and prosperity of Praetoria.<br><br>Afterwards you spoke to Washington, who asked that you go handle the fallout from this with Praetor White."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - WeaponsClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1028875780" "Weapons Cache"
// DetailString :
"P3849193232" "At first glance the weapons in the crate looked real enough, but once you picked one up you realized they were nothing more than a few real components attached to scrap."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - BombsClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3486639985" "Bombs"
// DetailString :
"P2042060056" "Luckily the bombs were on timers and you were able to disarm them before they went off. Somebody obviously wants you dead."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DoorClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3979717876" "Reinforced Door"
// DetailString :
"P3372722819" "The door took some effort to get through, but after you did you noticed that it was remote operated. Someone triggered this door manually."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TrapClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1145675143" "Trap"
// DetailString :
"P1175535361" "It's pretty obvious that you were expected and quite possibly even set up. Could Cleopatra be behind this?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DoorClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P713431281" "Cleopatra"
// DetailString :
"P651082270" "You disarmed the bombs, smashed through the sealed door, and then took out the hit team waiting to ambush you in case you survived. You questioned the punks sent to kill you and discovered that Cleopatra was the one who orchestrated this whole thing. She's a Resistance sympathizer!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TraitorLadyClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3634407984" "Traitor"
// DetailString :
"P2860719344" "According to Chief Interrogator Washington, Cleopatra is secretly a member of the Resistance. You are the witness he needs to uncover her treason."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - CalvinScot 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P292911340" "Kill Her"
// DetailString :
"P2882610197" "You spoke with Calvin Scott about Cleopatra's current situation. You were told by Calvin Scott to <i>kill</i> Cleopatra and take her place as a member of the Loyalists."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - NoMansLadySouvenirClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef Name :
"P2105290960" "Cleopatra's Plea"
// tDetailString :
"P1753536548" "During some downtime, you remember Cleopatra's plea to you, 'You know me! I helped you save the hospital!', when you and Washington confronted Cleopatra about her treason. It reminds you of an experience you call...<br><br><b><color Gold>No Man's Lady</color></b><br><br>Cleopatra asked you to investigate a Resistance weapons cache after you and her saved Cole Memorial Hospital. You were expecting a fight, of course, but learned that this was all a trap set up by Cleopatra herself! Interrogator Washington sent in Sergeant Faulks in an attempt to ensure you were not overwhelmed by the Resistance.<br><br>Afterwards you spoke with Washington, who informed you about Cleopatra's treason and that she was a member of the Resistance. She was out to kill you because you were the one piece of <i>physical</i> evidence that proved her guilt.<br><br>You and Washington confronted Cleopatra in her office, and it was there that you had to make a decision. Did you save Cleopatra's life at the expense of Washington's, or did you help Washington carry out his execution of Cleopatra?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Washington 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P2242888331" "{HeroName}, good to see you made it out of that fire fight alive. I was hoping Faulks would get there in time."
// Answer Text :
"P2684250615" "What's going on Washington? What do you know?"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P4202676104" "I'll tell you in one moment, {HeroName}. I just need to know one thing.<br><br>Were you the one who set those bugs up in the PPD Precinct?"
// Answer Text :
"P4206084314" "I was, now answer my question."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P4151795924" "<color orange>Washington smiles, letting out a relieved sigh.</color><br><br>I knew it. This was the final piece of the puzzle, {HeroName}. You were set up by Cleopatra.<br><br><color yellow>Cleopatra is a Resistance spy, a member of the Wardens.</color><br><br>She wanted you dead because you knew the answer to the question I just asked you."
// Answer Text :
"P1544080245" "How do the bugs prove that she's a spy?"
// Page InformationPage3 Text :
"P805723766" "Sergeant Chance, one of the men you bugged, was killed earlier. He was sent to investigate a Resistance weapons cache and was killed. The same cache <i>you</i> were sent to investigate.<br><br>There was no way for them to know about it...until we discovered a bug in his desk. I asked Cleopatra about the bug  - she claimed to not know about it, but I knew, I <i>knew</i> she was investigating something previously in that precinct. When I asked her where <i>you</i> went, she said to attack a warehouse the Resistance was holed up in.<br><br>My men reported back that it was empty - that was when I knew that Cleopatra was trying to kill you off, just like Chance.<br><br>You're the one person that can prove Cleopatra's guilt, {HeroName}! No one but you has the proof that <i>she</i> was the one who set up the bugs, which places <i>her</i> directly to blame for how the Resistance picked up the information on those bugs."
// Answer Text :
"P2034110836" "And now what, Washington?"
// Page NowWhat Text :
"P3408750834" "Now, we prepare ourselves. Talk to me when you're ready, {HeroName}.<br><br>We're going to put an end to Cleopatra's treason."
// Answer Text :
"P2389383533" "Got it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - WashingtonMission 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1879111021" "So then, are you ready to confront the woman who tried to orchestrate your death, {HeroName}?<br><br><color Paragon>Those members of the Resistance working undercover for Calvin Scott should inform him of what is happening - before going to confront Cleopatra.</color>."
// Answer Text :
"P164722086" "I'm ready, let's go."
// Answer Text :
"P1270900950" "I'm not ready, give me a minute."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - CalvinScott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3182877619" "{HeroName}, good to see you're still alive and breathing. Tell me what's going on."
// Answer Text :
"P708558365" "Cleopatra, she's an undercover agent. Did you know this?"
// Answer Text :
"P1649556231" "Cleopatra was with us the entire time, Scott! Why didn't you tell me? She tried to have me killed!"
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P2858534889" "I did know this. I'm assuming if you know this that it means she's been discovered.<br><br>Who found her out?"
// Answer Text :
"P631044092" "It was Washington. We're going to confront her now. What's the plan?"
// Page Killed Text :
"P220700244" "Part of the job, {HeroName}, I couldn't risk you knowing that she was an inside agent, just as I couldn't risk <i>her</i> knowing that you were on the inside as well. You might've acted differently with her, which would've caused someone to notice.<br><br>It was safer to have the two of you operating in the dark. You have to understand this, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P1228709232" "...alright, I understand. She's been discovered, however. What should we do?"
// Answer Text :
"P7478171" "I'm sticking my neck out here, Calvin, you can't leave me in the dark again. Are we clear?"
// Page Clear Text :
"P3353731627" "I know the risks you're taking for us, {HeroName}. When I <i>can</i>, I will do my best to inform you of what I know. That's the best I can do."
// Answer Text :
"P246064092" "Whatever. Look, Cleopatra's been outed by Washington. What's the 'plan'?"
// Page Explanation Text :
"P2064709392" "Washington is probably going to kill her. He's a cunning man, he knows that Marauder will do anything he can to prove her 'innocence'. Even so, it means that everything she does will be looked at with a suspicious eye.<br><br><color red>Help Washington and kill Cleopatra.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P564075485" "Understood, I'll make it happen."
// Answer Text :
"P2520619949" "What? She's one of us, Scott!"
// Page MakeitHappen Text :
"P2980684884" "Good, {HeroName}. When she's out of the picture, you'll take her place. Her death will assure you a concrete position within the Loyalists.<br><br>You'll just have to make sure not to make the same mistake that she did."
// Answer Text :
"P2725249948" "I don't plan on it."
// Page OneofUs Text :
"P3022521898" "She is. That is why she'll understand why this has to happen.<br><br>She was weak and paranoid, {HeroName}. Cleopatra let her guard down when she gave you those bugs and endangered <i>all</i> of us by making that decision to kill you.<br><br>She made her choice, and we've made ours. We can't allow her to go on.<br><br>Kill her, and take her place as our agent seeded deep within the Loyalists. Make sure to not make the same mistake that she did, {HeroName}. This isn't a game - I'll do whatever it takes to bring Cole down and get my wife back, even if it means having to deal with those who become weak in the face of our goal."
// Answer Text :
"P2095876435" "We'll see what happens, Scott."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page PickedResistance Text :
"P752484886" "{HeroName}, I'm sorry I couldn't go and let you know that I was with the Resistance. I thought you were just one of them two-bit Loyalists like Washington over here.<br><br>Believe me, I wouldn't have gone and tried to send you to your death and all if I knew you were gonna be on -our- side.<br><br>But we gotta make sure we get our stories straight about what happened here, you understand? Both of us are in too deep now to have our cover blown. I have an idea, though, on what we can do."
// Answer Text :
"P1896310260" "What's your idea?"
// Answer Text :
"P1369282437" "You should know, Cleopatra, that I spoke with Calvin Scott. He ordered me to kill you."
// Page KillOrder Text :
"P525548418" "We - what?<br><br>So Scott wanted me dead, huh? Can't say I blame him too much. I messed up, I got sloppy.<br><br>Now, this isn't me sayin' I'm fine with him tryin' to off me, suga'.<br><br>The man is gonna have to answer for this, but not now.<br><br>When we bring down Cole's empire, I'll be there, waitin' to deal with Scott myself. I'll show him just exactly what happens when you try to backstab me.<br><br>Meantime, you and me, suga', we got ourselves a situation to handle."
// Answer Text :
"P1480566491" "What's the plan?"
// Page ResistantIdea Text :
"P4243005577" "We take Washington's evidence and turn it on him.<br><br>We make it look like <i>he</i> was the spy from the Resistance. I can get my people to back that claim as well."
// Answer Text :
"P3841849365" "So...we say that we lured him here to reveal his actions?"
// Page RevealActions Text :
"P3813192406" "Exactly.<br><br>We wanted to bring him in, but he tried to kill the both of us - right in the heart of Cole's tower. Isn't that a shame?<br><br>We had no choice but to put him down - he was too dangerous to just let go.<br><br>All that said and done, we ain't going to be worrying about our covers being blown.<br><br>However, you're gonna have to be the one to break the news to Michael about Washington. I've got to deal with cleaning things up in my office. You okay with that?"
// Answer Text :
"P1307245082" "Speaking to Praetor White is never pleasant, but I'll do it."
// Page SpeaktoMarauder Text :
"P2897855071" "Great. Now get goin' before anyone starts getting suspicious. And {HeroName}?<br><br>Thanks. You chose the right side."
// Answer Text :
"P691144458" "Don't worry about it."
// Page PickedLoyalist Text :
"P1484079505" "It isn't easy serving Praetoria, {HeroName}.<br><br>We all thought Cleopatra was one of us. I didn't want to believe it when my evidence began to point towards her.<br><br>We did the right thing. If we arrested her, we would have to deal with Praetor White. He would have shattered the peace that we're trying to hard to keep in Nova just to prove her 'innocence'.<br><br>Her death was the only way to keep the people of Praetoria safe. You understand, I'm sure.<br><br>All that is left is cleaning up some loose ends."
// Answer Text :
"P3388679347" "What else is hanging?"
// Page Hanging Text :
"P3238206180" "Dealing with Praetor White.<br><br>Someone is going to have to speak with him regarding what happened today.<br><br>I believe that someone should be <i>you</i>, {HeroName}.<br><br>Tell him what happened here - but tell him that <i>I</i> killed Cleopatra. If you tell him you had any role in harming her, he will strike you down where you stand. I don't want to see that happen, not to you.<br><br>He will be angry, but you must remind him that he serves <i>Praetoria</i> now, not his own selfish ambitions.<br><br>Do we have an agreement on this?"
// Answer Text :
"P2736192121" "I'll speak with Praetor White."
// Page SpeakWithWhite Text :
"P1475757394" "Excellent. Good luck speaking with him, {HeroName}."
// Answer Text :
"P1701062959" "Thanks, Washington"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marauder 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3049748495" "Eh? What do you want, {HeroName}?"
// Answer Text :
"P1987549867" "I've got some unfortunate news - Chief Interrogator Washington was a traitor."
// Answer Text :
"P3835800858" "Your girlfriend, Cleopatra. She was a member of the Resistance."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P3590852010" "What?! Washington a traitor?!<br><br>You better have some proof of this, {HeroName}, or else I'm gonna fling your sorry self straight to the top of Cole's tower!"
// Answer Text :
"P1859946160" "Easy there. Cleopatra has all the evidence you'll need."
// Page InformationPage2 Text :
"P1913116674" "Wha?<br><br>Huh...well, would you look at that. So the two of you went and caught yourselves a traitor. And Washington! I would've thought that guy would be the <i>last</i> person to betray us. Goes to show how much you can trust someone.<br><br>Well, good on you for doing that, {HeroName}, along with my girl Cleo.<br><br>Gotta say, it's refreshin' to know that there's someone like you here weedin' out the traitors. Just be careful you don't get too full of yourself and point your finger at someone who ain't a traitor."
// Answer Text :
"P2031176861" "Wouldn't dream of it, Praetor White. I'll be taking my leave now."
// Page Cleopatra1 Text :
"P886475181" "What?!<br><br>This ain't funny, {HeroName}, you got two seconds to explain yourself! What's going on here?!"
// Answer Text :
"P128246723" "(Explain Washington's investigation and execution)"
// Page Cleopatra2 Text :
"P161510846" "<color orange>Praetor White looks down, clenching his fists</color><br><br>....<br><br>So...Washington went and offed her, huh...guess he had a point. I woulda gotten Cleo outta anything. Had to do what he had to do.<br><br>All for Cole's empire and safety, yeah?<br><br><color orange>Praetor White stomps his foot hard on the ground, letting out a grunt.</color><br><br>That's how it's gotta be, {HeroName}. You take a lesson from all this. Me? I was blinded by that woman. Who knows how long she was in the Resistance for? How long she was usin' me? I ain't gonna let it happen again though.<br><br>I don't care that she 'betrayed' Marcus' whole damn regime, I just care that she went and played me like that. Just...stay outta my way for now, {HeroName}. You see me walkin' into the tunnels, you better believe that I'm gonna kill any of those pieces of filth I come across."
// Answer Text :
"P1759055666" "Alright, Praetor White. I'll leave you to your thoughts."
// Answer Text :
"P1819991712" "That's it? Your girlfriend dies and that's all you have to say?"
// Page AllyouHave Text :
"P4291101885" "You got a better idea, {HeroName}?!<br><br>You don't wanna start this conversation, {HeroName}, I'm warnin' you, 'cause it ain't gonna end well for you!"
// Answer Text :
"P4104888280" "Alright, whatever, I'm backing off."
// Answer Text :
"P640431906" "I'm starting it, White. Did you even -care- about her?"
// Page Care Text :
"P424994637" "<color orange>Praetor White lets out a deep growl, hovering over you.</color><br><br>You think I'm heartless, {HeroName}?! You ain't just gonna be with someone for all that time and not care!<br><br>But she betrayed me, betrayed what we had, made me look like a fool! You think I'm gonna be fine with that?!<br><br>I ain't! And it's all 'cause of them pieces of filth in the Resistance and old Marcus over there! If neither of 'em were part of this damn equation, this wouldn't be a problem, and she never woulda had to gone and do all that. But you know what? It's just how it is, 'til one of those two are taken care of."
// Answer Text :
"P3750830213" "The Resistance? Or Cole?"
// Page ResistanceOrCole Text :
"P2803382442" "<color orange>Praetor White remains silent for a moment.</color><br><br>Guess we'll see what happens. Now get outta here, I'm done talkin' with you."
// Answer Text :
"P960027277" "Nice chat, Praetor white."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2733149934" "Here's the deal, suga'. I just finished talkin' with Chief Interrogator Washington, and he told me that he and his boys found out where the Resistance are keepin' one of their main supplies in the tunnels.<br><br>He asked for me to see if you could go in there and retrieve it. He said he'd do it himself, but he and his boys are tryin' to locate a woman named <color yellow>Ricochet</color> for somethin' she went and did.<br><br>Shouldn't be too difficult for someone like you, right? He said the place has been abandoned, so it should just be a simple deal of takin' their supplies.</color><br><br><color yellow>This arc is a SINGLE PLAYER MORAL CHOICE story arc. You will not be able to have other people on your team assist you with this story arc.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P1326357165" "You'd be surprised how quickly 'simple' turns to 'complicated'."
// SendOffString :
"P1200615049" "Hah! I'm sure I would, suga'. I wouldn't worry too much about it, Washington is a good hound. He knows trouble when he sees it - believe me.<br><br>Here's the location of where this little box should be, just make sure to watch your back."
// TaskTitle :
"P486467730" "<color deepskyblue>No Man's Lady</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2921084687" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: You Know Me</color>"

