// SaysList :
"P3179786498" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SteelBlue>Hello?! Hello! {HeroName}! This is Chief Interrogator Washington!<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SteelBlue>Cleopatra set you up - I'm fighting off some of the Resistance going after you, but I couldn't get them all!<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SteelBlue>I'm doing everything I can here to help, you need to take down the Resistance, then meet me up in Nova!"
// SaysList :
"P472261516" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SteelBlue>Destroying this computer doesn't matter. We already have the locations of every person the Resistance has funneled out of Praetoria. You lose, {HeroName}."
// SaysList :
"P2189560554" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>We're under attack here by the PPD!<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>You might run into a few of 'em yourself up ahead!<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>These guys will attack you on sight, but you can try to get the drop on them first!"
// SaysList :
"P1577115295" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>Ugh! Hey give that radio ba-!"
// SaysList :
"P1808450874" "<t=4 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>Word on the street is that you ain't too pleased with being part of the Powers Division.<t=5 caption x= 0.6 y=0.5  d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor SlateGray>We could use more folks like you, people willin' to talk back to them guys in power. We meet up, we can - wha?! Hold on {HeroName}, it's the PPD!"

